{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>To burn [לבער] Cain.</b> Like ושבה והיתה לבער, and likewise כאשר יבער הגלל, and ובערת הרע. And Cain [קין] is the Kenite [הקיני]." "And the meaning of <b>Until what [עד מה] will Asshur take you captive [תשבך]</b> — as if saying, Until when will Asshur take you captive, he will not let you go. For if לבער and Asshur are feminine language, the meaning is 'camp,' likewise ותפול שבא ותקחם ותערוך ישראל."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:22.297573799Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}